{"id":"d42c50d86a16e6af","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-sigma1-complete.md","title":"Sigma-1 Completeness","display":"thm-sigma1-complete — Sigma-1 Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-sigma1-complete","aliases":["88-thm-sigma1-complete"],"display":"thm-sigma1-complete — Sigma-1 Completeness","depends_on":["[[88-df-sigma1-formula]]","[[88-df-sentence]]","[[88-df-structure]]","[[88-df-satisfaction]]","[[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[88-df-inference-rule]]","[[88-df-provable]]","[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","[[88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure]]","[[88-df-classical-calculus]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-sigma1-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-sigma1-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sigma1-complete — Sigma-1 Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f6bf5bbb27f40f4b\" href=\"?note=f6bf5bbb27f40f4b\" title=\"88-df-sigma1-formula\">88-df-sigma1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"29a1e5bf3eb93726\" href=\"?note=29a1e5bf3eb93726\" title=\"88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure\">88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\">\\(\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\\)</span> (syntactic formula class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f6bf5bbb27f40f4b\" href=\"?note=f6bf5bbb27f40f4b\" title=\"88-df-sigma1-formula\">88-df-sigma1-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (standard <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>-structure)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (Robinson arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3f44d69945b890a4\" href=\"?note=3f44d69945b890a4\" title=\"88-df-robinson-arithmetic\">88-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (standard inference-rule parameter for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_R\">\\(\\vdash_R\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 的完整定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"29a1e5bf3eb93726\" href=\"?note=29a1e5bf3eb93726\" title=\"88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure\">88-df-standard-arithmetic-structure</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"0aa80b611d62ec1b\" href=\"?note=0aa80b611d62ec1b\" title=\"88-df-classical-calculus\">88-df-classical-calculus</a>。断言另要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\vdash_R\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(Q\\vdash_R\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>；这是一项关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的显式前提，不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的七条公理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>例如可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\rangle\\}\">\\(R=R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\rangle\\}\\)</span>；原始关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 的解释条件不能只用“标准演算”四字代替。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\n\\land Q\\vdash_R\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\n\\land\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\varphi\n\\to Q\\vdash_R\\varphi\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}complete}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\Bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)\n\\land Q\\vdash_R\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\varphi\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\n\\land\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\varphi\n\\to Q\\vdash_R\\varphi\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的七条公理没有提及原始关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>。在其经典一阶模型中可以任意解释 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>，故没有附加条件时，连标准为真的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar0&lt;\\bar1\">\\(\\bar0&lt;\\bar1\\)</span> 也不一定是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的后承。原断言还把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的全称量词限制在蕴涵前件内，使后件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 游离。</p>\n<p>现在保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>、公式类和可证关系接口，把次序解释写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\vdash_R\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(Q\\vdash_R\\mathrm{OrdAx}_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>。在该条件下，固定数词界内的量化可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 化成有限个数词实例；按有界公式结构归纳，真闭 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 公式可证，再为真 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 句加入其标准数词见证，得到结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"f6bf5bbb27f40f4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sigma1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"13ac48daafe6d04f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"7d0aefc635fe57fc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"3f44d69945b890a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"c7ab6c8e893872fb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-inference-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-formul